Hi {Owner},

I build websites for equipment and tool rental yards around {City}. I couldn't find a list of what {Business Name} rents, the rates, or a way to check if a machine is free on a given day.

I built a sample first rather than ask for your time: a rental catalogue with a page per machine and day, week and month rates, an availability check by date, a contractor account application and an off-rent request, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, no problem, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

